    "biography": {
      "concept": "The anvil man of Chuckle Creek (Act 2)",
      "notes": "Hollis Bandy is the anvil man of Chuckle Creek. Every episode an anvil lands on his head, he flattens to the thickness of a playing card, springs back, and tips his hat. He says nothing, ever. Ask him a question and he tips his hat. The town keeps time by him."
